<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Suriname</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Suriname is a country on the north-eastern coast of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/south-america">South America</a>, formerly a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch">Dutch</a> colony. Accounts of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch-empire">Dutch Empire</a> note that Suriname became independent on 25 November 1975. This closed the Dutch colonial account.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/suriname.jpg" alt="Suriname" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: See File history below for details. · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Suriname.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
